<title>USA: Quick &amp; Reilly Group Inc Q3 Nov 29 net up. [CORRECTED 23:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Quick &amp; Reilly Group Inc Q3 Nov 29 net up. [CORRECTED 23:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects fiscal quarter end to November from October in headline)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.73		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net			 18,437		   15,132</p>
<p> Revs		     118,059		  109,010</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,173		   25,009</p>
<p>		    Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.34		    $1.77</p>
<p> Net			 58,806		   44,046</p>
<p> Revs		     367,384		  314,191</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,176		   24,950</p>
<p>(Corrects avg shrs outstanding for year-ago period to 24,950</p>
<p>from 24,850)</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Revenues are gross revenues. Net revenues were $87.0 million vs $79.1 million in quarter and $275.9 million vs $223.0 million in nine months. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
